  "description": "Implements a Zip archive, zipped file and folder entities for the Xceed FileSystem. Create and update zip files of any size. Zip/Unzip data directly into/from a Zip stream with Real-Time Zip. Optional encryption. Optional Self-extractor on .NET. Widely used and backed by a responsive support and development team whose sole ambition is your complete satisfaction.\n\nYou can try this package for free for 45 days, after which you will need to purchase a license key to continue using it.",
